    "note": "isStable is true for all 9 here because none of these real Forge build strings contain a dash themselves; the field genuinely varies only when a pre-release Forge build (e.g. \"47.4.5-beta\") appears in the raw list, which this corpus snapshot doesn't happen to carry"
  },
  "notes": "The `mc—55.1.13` / `mc—55.0.24` pair from forge-maven-metadata-parsed-to-mc-forge-pairs both survive into the final sorted picker list as two separate rows with the SAME `displayLabel`/`mcVersion` (\"1.21.5\") but different `id`s -- deduplication is keyed on the combined `\"{mc}—{forge}\"` id (line 431-433), never on `mc` alone, precisely because modpacks pin exact non-recommended Forge builds and the picker must be able to offer both. Sort is descending MC version first, then descending Forge version within a tied MC (lines 444-448) -- this is why 55.1.13 (newer Forge build) lists above 55.0.24 for the same 1.21.5 line.",
